    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of an army in fierce real-time battles! Upgrade your troops, build siege machines and challenge up to three opponents in a fast-paced, arcade-style RTS with a unique style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a world where every battle is a flurry of action and strategic decisions. Manage your army in real time, build fortifications and siege weapons, develop your units and crush your enemies on the battlefield. The game offers an arcade approach to RTS where the emphasis is on dynamics, variety of tactics and quick decision making.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Up to three enemies on the map at a time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Army upgrades and unit upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Siege structures and different types of troops</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fast, intense battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Stylized visuals</p>",
